Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:08.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 天空拳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:08.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:10.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:14.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.23,0:00:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:31.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,欸啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:36.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有受傷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.95,0:00:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說... 小晴啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:53.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:56.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:00:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:03.32,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 愛愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:06.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:08.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 不好意思 難得你們沉浸到了幸福的氛圍裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.59,0:01:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們被好多人盯著！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:35.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,各位！放心吧！已經安全了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小晴 我的意思是...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（警笛聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:40.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼聲音？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.95,0:01:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給大家添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:48.88,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻... 愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}英雄來我家!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1710,935)}哈 哈 哈 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}（腳步聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.67,0:03:49.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 這裡就是真白同學的家嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:52.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,難道說 真白同學是這個世界的公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白姬嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接就把人帶回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來要怎麼辦啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白 歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 大概你不會相信剛才發生的事 但是先聽我說！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們是從天上 咻地！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後怪物 啪地！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後來 後來... 一閃一閃地發光 嘩地一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到麻煩了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:26.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 快進來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？我自己都覺得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶你居然 接受剛才我說的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:37.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:41.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地... 居然有與這裡不同的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(570,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在還是很難以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:56.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:59.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,很難想像自己已經到了另一個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:12.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,自己還變身成了Cure Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那支不可思議的筆 究竟是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure又是什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶啊 你房間裡的百科辭典上面 有沒有記錄關於Precure的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 幫我查一查...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:47.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,先不用管我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:50.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,當務之急是找到送這娃娃回去的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟她約好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:58.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,送她回爸爸媽媽那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:03.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄絕對不會看著正在哭泣的孩子置之不理的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:06.38,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是嚇到她了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:09.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.15,0:06:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看這裡 不見了 不見了 吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:14.89,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:20.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會是... 肚子餓了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個！我去買牛奶！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 便利商店有買牛奶嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有要什麼口味的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛... 牛... 牛奶... 在哪裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廚櫃最下面有奶粉和奶瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溫度要控制在差不多體溫上下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:42.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呼哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.15,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,咳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:55.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我家裡有一個小我很多歲的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,已經很熟練了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？我還是覺得很厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶 為什麼我們家裡會有奶粉和奶瓶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有尿布呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相逢沒有偶然
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人與人的邂逅 不管在哪個年代 都是必然 都是命運...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.11,0:07:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是故事的序幕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在找到回去你們世界的方法之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請隨意使用2樓的空房間
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:34.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}等等... 奶奶！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被從家裡拐出來 飛到別的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還被怪物追... 真是災難的一天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:52.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我再確認一下... 真白同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:57.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們真的能使用這間房間嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該可以的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:04.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太不好意思了 我會盡快搬出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:08.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還要幫家裡做事... 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.71,0:08:13.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:18.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對不會忘記今天的恩情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:21.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鄙人·晴雯麗 在此宣誓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,願成為守護真白同學的騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:25.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,獻身心 盡忠義
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:27.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}誓死保護你的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是在演古裝片嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不用什麼騎士？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:33.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 那我該怎麼辦...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想想...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了！就從朋友開始做起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.47,0:08:46.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了！替換衣服暫時就用我的運動服吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我們再去買新的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有什麼需要的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的房間就在隔壁 儘管...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...來 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒頭就睡啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊 不奇怪...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（咕...）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,早安！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:46.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呼哇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.69,0:09:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝了好多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.97,0:09:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是去多買一點奶粉比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 是這樣做來著嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.27,0:09:59.33,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,咳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:11.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好... 好... 好...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:17.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃！這是什麼？這什麼魚！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:20.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一點也不腥 魚肉彈牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.61,0:10:23.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鮮味輕柔地在嘴巴裡擴散開來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:27.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,汪洋大海就彷彿展現在了眼前！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是美食評論嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多吃一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！我不客氣了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！啊 那個是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:47.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅乾的味道 沒那麼快適應吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:50.81,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這些去買小晴妹妹的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有我昨天拜託你的東西 也不要忘記買
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 玫瑰香油 肉桂條... 還有青蛙幹吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是做什麼用的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們去購物吧 我來照顧這個小娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:24.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:27.43,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:32.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠乖乖地待在家裡嗎？小空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:34.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:38.23,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊... 不知道她的真名啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:45.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼 我只是想起了一個好聽的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你們快去快回
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:52.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天追著你的那個人... 是叫做...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:12:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是坐墊？還是豬排飯？（押韻腳）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:02.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得就是差不多的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會還逗留在那附近？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是又一下蹦出來 怎麼辦啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:10.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我會趕走他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:12.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 就交給我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}（手機鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:14.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.53,0:12:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉 我到車站附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠放心交給你嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.87,0:12:22.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然驚慌失措...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:25.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,火中也好 水中也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:26.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄啊 不管身處什麼環境
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:29.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都必須要做到沉著冷靜！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:32.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,被這個世界的機械嚇到 這是最後一次了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市 購物中心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,建... 建築物裡面有市場
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 要走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:45.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,樓梯在動
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,人... 人偶在說話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:53.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 你退後！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡面有古怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:13:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 真要說的話 我們反而更怪吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:04.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 該選哪一套運動服好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還可以選擇運動服之外的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我就沒有想過還能買別的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.72,0:13:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有的啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:16.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 我有事麻煩你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.87,0:13:20.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能幫我挑選衣服嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:23.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道應該怎麼挑選...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.21,0:13:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！我來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.65,0:13:32.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“要怎麼樣才能成為英雄呢？"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:36.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,從小時候起 我滿腦子就是在琢磨這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:40.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒在在意過什麼服裝 打扮...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:46.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好看嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:49.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:54.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:13:58.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:01.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能問一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴為什麼會這麼執著於成為一個英雄？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:12.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為我遇到過真正的英雄... 吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:19.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小時候 我在一個大人叮囑過不能去的森林裡 迷路了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:26.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:32.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:39.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天 我見到了真正的...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:41.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,遇見了我的英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:44.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要和那個人一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:47.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為此 每天都在鍛鍊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,編寫英雄手帳...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄手帳？啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那本手帳是這麼重要的物品啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:14.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}大口大漢堡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:23.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃！力氣這就上來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:25.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吃了這些...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:27.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 是你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐... 坐墊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:31.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼坐墊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:33.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,老子是卡疤痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:36.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,死性不改 又在做壞事！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:39.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我饒不了你 豬排飯！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:42.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了老子叫卡疤痛！你們是存心的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.91,0:15:45.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那小鬼頭在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.49,0:15:48.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 居然還沒有死心 還想要搶小空嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:52.45,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:57.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 算了 先要回敬你昨天的份！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:16:01.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,先把你揍個滿頭包 再一寸寸地撬開你的嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:04.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:16.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:19.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:21.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈 呀哈 呀哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:42.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱爆了！而老子強炸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去避難！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼選擇了她？天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對 現在是小空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:06.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我還不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:10.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,距離我崇拜的那個人的背影 還很遙遠...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:13.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 現在...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:23.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:30.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:30.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:40.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:42.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:42.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:52.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:52.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:00.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:00.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.60,0:18:08.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.60,0:18:08.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:31.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:33.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:33.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:40.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:47.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,變身了呢 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.93,0:18:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.97,0:18:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:55.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:01.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:06.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:11.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:13.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉開距離 亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:16.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.91,0:19:21.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:23.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,給我認真打！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:25.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.09,0:19:26.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:28.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:31.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:35.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧？啊... 別... 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:38.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！來發大的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:43.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:48.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:51.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,被接住了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:57.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大！回！轉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:19:59.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,開玩笑的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 四兩撥千斤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:06.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂亂亂... 亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:12.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 天空拳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:12.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:15.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky... 好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.09,0:20:41.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡... 卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.21,0:20:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:54.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂的 真白同學 在引起騷動之前...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:57.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.19,0:21:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}唯美著迷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒有賣完！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(612,909)}{\fs50}在特別的日子送給最喜歡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}唯美著迷文具
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:10.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.27,0:21:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:13.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼突然...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.22,0:21:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個能代替你的英雄手帳嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:19.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可愛的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.43,0:21:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在上架前 我就有留意商品訊息 一直在攢零用錢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.53,0:21:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是現在需要這個的不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是小晴你 怎麼樣？讓我送你一份禮物吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:35.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不行的！我怎麼能收下！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:40.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我見到了真正的英雄... 了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.59,0:21:55.08,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故事開始了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:21:59.35,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.75,0:22:08.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,下週開始 在片尾的某處
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定會有別的Precure好姐妹登場哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:12.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,每週都要留意哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.39,0:23:47.38,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.56,0:23:49.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是想回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少能讓她見到爸爸媽媽...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.68,0:23:54.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.74,0:23:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 要怎麼才能辦到？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.63,0:23:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:23:59.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:23:59.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.25,0:24:03.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嚶嚶啜泣想家家！小空不要哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:51.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:57.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.29,0:02:02.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:10.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.55,0:02:15.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:19.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:21.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:25.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:30.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:32.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:36.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:40.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:44.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:44.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:46.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:46.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:51.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:56.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:03:01.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:06.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.86,0:03:09.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:17.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:29.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.67,0:22:34.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:37.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.01,0:22:38.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.85,0:22:41.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:44.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.15,0:22:46.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.11,0:22:48.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:51.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.57,0:22:53.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:55.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:02.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:08.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.29,0:23:10.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.34,0:23:15.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.01,0:23:19.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:25.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:29.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.61,0:23:33.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:37.49,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.47,0:23:38.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.87,0:23:41.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
